  "changelog": "Initial release of Bid Opportunity Advisor\n\n- Provides actionable analysis to help users decide whether to pursue specific bid opportunities.\n- Matches public procurement listings with the user\u2019s company profile for fit (qualification, region, product, scale).\n- Delivers go/no-go recommendations with supporting reasoning and stated confidence level based on sample size.\n- Lists actionable next steps: suitable open bids, price recommendations, primary competitors, and gaps.\n- Strict privacy safeguards: never collects device info or creates accounts without user consent.\n- Requires explicit company profile setup; avoids data fabrication or unauthorized file creation.",
